WEBVTT

00:32.040 --> 00:35.790
<b>HS 3rd Year
Renge Serizawa</b>

00:41.630 --> 00:43.040
<b>Hmm?</b>

00:44.000 --> 00:45.750
<b>Where is everyone?</b>

00:50.920 --> 00:54.380
<b>HS 2nd Year
Kurumi Tokiwa</b>

00:56.290 --> 00:58.290
<b>So there you were!</b>

00:58.500 --> 00:59.500
<b>Renge!</b>

00:59.830 --> 01:00.830
<b>Kurumi!</b>

01:01.000 --> 01:02.130
<b>Wake up!</b>

01:03.290 --> 01:05.040
<b>I need you to stay conscious!</b>

01:07.960 --> 01:09.420
<b>What?!</b>

01:10.170 --> 01:11.540
<b>Ewww!</b>

01:19.210 --> 01:20.960
<b>Go softer on me, would you?</b>

01:22.580 --> 01:25.290
<b>What was that, just now?</b>

01:25.420 --> 01:27.790
<b>HS 3rd Year
Asuha Kusunoki</b>

01:25.710 --> 01:27.790
<b>A direct attack on your subconscious.</b>

01:28.210 --> 01:31.920
<b>Those tentacles seem capable of
some form of mind control.</b>

01:32.250 --> 01:35.420
<b>Oh, was that what that was?</b>

01:35.960 --> 01:37.460
<b>It's fine!</b>

01:38.000 --> 01:39.540
<b>Just don't get caught!</b>

01:39.540 --> 01:40.420
<b>That's all.</b>

01:40.420 --> 01:41.250
<b>Let's go!</b>

01:52.080 --> 01:53.080
<b>Be gone!</b>

02:05.710 --> 02:06.920
<b>Hoshimori.</b>

02:06.920 --> 02:10.080
<b>Donning their celestial suits with
the power of the Holy Tree,</b>

02:10.080 --> 02:14.920
<b>they stand as humanity's only hope
against the mysterious Irous invaders.</b>

02:15.670 --> 02:20.750
<b>And this, this is the story of both
their battles and their comradery.</b>

02:24.670 --> 02:30.750
<b>Ima meippai no hoshizora ni 
yume no seiza o mitsukeyou</b>

02:30.750 --> 02:39.170
<b>Kokoro o tsunaidara itsuka kanaeru yo</b>

02:47.460 --> 02:52.420
<b>Hashiridasu junbi wa dekita ka na</b>

02:52.880 --> 02:57.960
<b>Nagai michi demo nakama ga iru kara</b>

02:58.380 --> 03:02.670
<b>Fuange na kao shite mayou yori</b>

03:02.670 --> 03:07.630
<b>Tobikonde waraou</b>

03:08.210 --> 03:13.670
<b>Surechigai de kousa shita heart mo</b>

03:13.670 --> 03:16.380
<b>Kizuna e to kawaru desho</b>

03:16.380 --> 03:23.500
<b>Kasanetara hitotsu ni shite 
mirai o tsukamu chikara ni</b>

03:24.170 --> 03:30.000
<b>Ima meippai no hoshizora 
e yume o zutto oikakete</b>

03:30.000 --> 03:35.420
<b>Nobashita tenohira wa 
akiramenai omoi o kureru</b>

03:35.420 --> 03:40.920
<b>Nanbyaku kai no chousen mo 
hitori nanka ja nai kara</b>

03:40.920 --> 03:47.920
<b>Daijoubu kao o agete kitto starry sky</b>

03:47.920 --> 03:50.790
<b>Kanaeru yo</b>

03:53.080 --> 03:58.040
<b>Episode 6
Renge is Kurumi and Kurumi is Renge</b>

04:17.290 --> 04:19.540
<b>Did I oversleep or something?</b>

04:19.920 --> 04:22.380
<b>My head feels like a brick.</b>

04:26.330 --> 04:27.670
<b>Morning!</b>

04:27.670 --> 04:30.170
<b>I never thought I'd see you sleep in!</b>

04:31.000 --> 04:32.580
<b>Oh, g'morning!</b>

04:32.580 --> 04:35.880
<b>You better go water your flowers,
I bet they're waiting for you!</b>

04:37.210 --> 04:39.130
<b>Good morning!</b>

04:39.420 --> 04:40.420
<b>Mornin'...</b>

04:41.250 --> 04:42.330
<b>Huh?</b>

04:42.330 --> 04:44.960
<b>Wait, why do I have to water the flowers...?</b>

04:44.960 --> 04:48.420
<b>Hey, hey, Haruka!
Whaddya think is for breakfast today?</b>

04:48.420 --> 04:50.630
<b>Should be omurice today I think.</b>

04:50.630 --> 04:55.130
<b>Yipee! Omurice! Omurice!</b>

04:56.330 --> 04:59.330
<b>Maybe I should shorten my bangs a bit.</b>

04:59.670 --> 05:04.670
<b>Oh no! You look cute like... that...</b>

05:06.790 --> 05:08.040
<b>Okay...</b>

05:08.040 --> 05:10.290
<b>Let's just settle down for a 
second and think, shall we?</b>

05:10.750 --> 05:14.880
<b>I'm pretty sure I was still myself
when I went to bed last night.</b>

05:19.000 --> 05:22.000
<b>But just look at these lovely curves!</b>

05:23.330 --> 05:25.250
<b>These lovely long legs!</b>

05:25.250 --> 05:28.080
<b>This almost divine body!</b>

05:30.330 --> 05:32.830
<b>This all definitely belongs to Kurumi!</b>

05:33.880 --> 05:35.250
<b>Does that mean...</b>

05:35.250 --> 05:39.420
<b>if I'm Kurumi, then Kurumi must be me?</b>

05:39.960 --> 05:41.630
<b>Then that would mean...?!</b>

05:44.750 --> 05:47.080
<b>That sun sure feels great today!</b>

05:47.330 --> 05:50.420
<b>You're quite the morning person aren't you?</b>

05:47.790 --> 05:52.880
<b>JH 1st Year
Hinata Minami   Sakura Fujimiya   Sadone</b>

05:51.080 --> 05:52.380
<b>You think so?</b>

05:55.210 --> 05:56.710
<b>What's the matter, Sadone?</b>

05:57.130 --> 05:58.040
<b>Huh...?</b>

06:04.710 --> 06:08.540
<b>Is that Renge... watering the flowers?</b>

06:08.960 --> 06:11.500
<b>This world may still be 
full of surprises yet!</b>

06:11.960 --> 06:14.500
<b>This may very well be sign 
of an approaching storm.</b>

06:15.080 --> 06:19.040
<b>Oh, Hinata-san, Sadone-san, Sakura-san.</b>

06:19.790 --> 06:21.630
<b>Sakura...san?</b>

06:22.630 --> 06:23.830
<b>Good morning!</b>

06:25.040 --> 06:29.420
<b>R-Renge, what are you doing out here?</b>

06:40.830 --> 06:42.750
<b>Pray tell... what just happened?</b>

06:42.750 --> 06:44.000
<b>No idea.</b>

06:52.330 --> 06:55.670
<b>Why are you all flustered like this?</b>

06:56.960 --> 06:59.540
<b>Wh-why, you ask?</b>

06:59.880 --> 07:03.710
<b>Wh-why aren't you flustered?</b>

07:03.960 --> 07:06.880
<b>Wha-?! M-Me?</b>

07:08.710 --> 07:11.210
<b>So you finally noticed?</b>

07:13.750 --> 07:20.380
<b>So, I've become you, and 
you've become me, is it?</b>

07:20.380 --> 07:22.000
<b>It appears that way.</b>

07:22.000 --> 07:23.960
<b>I dunno why though!</b>

07:24.130 --> 07:25.750
<b>What should we do?</b>

07:26.130 --> 07:29.830
<b>Okay, first, we should tell the teachers.</b>

07:29.830 --> 07:31.170
<b>Hey, hold up!</b>

07:33.080 --> 07:38.000
<b>We may have taken back the Earth,
but we have yet to put an end to the Irous.</b>

07:38.000 --> 07:42.630
<b>Instead, we've actually seen
even stronger forms than ever before.</b>

07:42.920 --> 07:47.710
<b>We're at a time of crisis,
you know that, don't you Kurumi?</b>

07:48.130 --> 07:49.750
<b>O-of course...</b>

07:49.750 --> 07:56.040
<b>At times like these, I just can't see how troubling
our teachers over something so trifling would help.</b>

07:56.330 --> 07:58.330
<b>Is this really a trifling matter?</b>

07:58.330 --> 07:59.920
<b>Most trifling!</b>

08:00.540 --> 08:03.750
<b>So how about we just keep 
this to ourselves for a bit?</b>

08:03.750 --> 08:06.330
<b>For... a bit?</b>

08:06.630 --> 08:07.500
<b>Exactly!</b>

08:07.750 --> 08:09.880
<b>Let's make this a promise just between us!</b>

08:10.580 --> 08:11.880
<b>W-well okay...</b>

08:15.750 --> 08:17.420
<b>The Hoshimori Class...</b>

08:15.750 --> 08:18.750
<b>Hoshimori Class</b>

08:17.420 --> 08:20.960
<b>once a place where I was so 
close-knit with everyone.</b>

08:20.960 --> 08:23.040
<b>And kept records of each and every girl.</b>

08:23.040 --> 08:25.130
<b>Basically it was my version of paradise.</b>

08:31.040 --> 08:33.170
<b>Taking pictures like this...</b>

08:33.420 --> 08:35.420
<b>And pictures like that...</b>

08:41.580 --> 08:44.830
<b>And then we would do a little bit of this,
and a little bit of that...</b>

08:45.420 --> 08:50.710
<b>But now, not a single one of them
lets their guard down in front of me...</b>

08:51.420 --> 08:53.790
<b>But now with this body...!</b>

08:53.790 --> 08:57.040
<b>I'll finally be able to do all 
of this and that all over again!</b>

09:01.460 --> 09:03.130
<b>Good morning!</b>

09:03.130 --> 09:04.000
<b>G'morning!</b>

09:04.000 --> 09:05.710
<b>Good morning girls!</b>

09:05.830 --> 09:06.540
<b>Huh?</b>

09:06.540 --> 09:08.960
<b>G-Good morning.</b>

09:13.790 --> 09:16.080
<b>Hey, Renge?</b>

09:16.420 --> 09:17.380
<b>Huh?</b>

09:17.380 --> 09:21.670
<b>Is there some reason you're 
sitting in my seat?</b>

09:22.000 --> 09:23.170
<b>Oh...</b>

09:23.920 --> 09:26.170
<b>Come on, Kurumi.</b>

09:26.500 --> 09:31.630
<b>You're supposed to be me now,
so you need to sit in my seat too, you know!</b>

09:31.630 --> 09:35.380
<b>Th-that's true, sorry.</b>

09:35.750 --> 09:41.000
<b>We can't have anyone figuring out we've
swapped bodies, so you need to act more like me!</b>

09:41.000 --> 09:42.750
<b>R-right...</b>

09:43.880 --> 09:46.500
<b>Act like you, hmm...</b>

09:48.630 --> 09:51.580
<b>Oh my! But I could never!</b>

09:51.580 --> 09:55.130
<b>Now wait a sec! Just what are you imagining?!</b>

09:55.580 --> 09:57.130
<b>Touchy-touch!</b>

09:58.000 --> 09:59.830
<b>Wh-wh-what's the big idea all of a sudden?!</b>

09:59.830 --> 10:01.500
<b>S-s-sorry about that...</b>

10:03.330 --> 10:07.920
<b>No, but seriously... is 
this how people imagine me?</b>

10:08.080 --> 10:12.040
<b>Kurumi Tokiwa (2nd Year HS)
Birthday: September 30th
Sign: Libra
Blood Type: AB
Measurements: 91/62/89
Height: 158cm
Weight: 46kg
Hobby: Gardening
Idol: Her mother
Ideal Downtime:
Spending time with her plants in her greenhouse 
Dream Job: Botanist</b>

10:12.130 --> 10:16.080
<b>Michelle Watagi (2nd Year JH)
Birthday: June 3rd
Sign: Gemini
Blood Type: O
Measurements: 84/56/78
Height: 145cm
Weight: 39kg
Hobby: Knitting
Idol: Her mother
Ideal Downtime:
Playing with her stuffed animals 
Dream: To turn into a stuffed animal</b>

10:27.630 --> 10:29.130
<b>And now I'm ready!</b>

10:30.080 --> 10:31.830
<b>Time for my shoot!</b>

10:43.040 --> 10:46.630
<b>Kurumi is just so adorable 
in anything she wears!</b>

10:47.040 --> 10:50.880
<b>Okay then, time for even more photo ops!</b>

10:54.080 --> 10:55.880
<b>Yeah, exactly!</b>

10:58.380 --> 11:00.540
<b>Urara, Kokomi...</b>

10:59.380 --> 11:01.630
<b>JH 3rd Year
Kokomi Asahina    Urara Hasumi</b>

11:02.000 --> 11:04.580
<b>Oh, Kuru-Kuru. What's the matter?</b>

11:05.630 --> 11:08.920
<b>Well... I have a favor to ask you two.</b>

11:10.460 --> 11:11.710
<b>Wha-?!</b>

11:11.710 --> 11:14.750
<b>You want us to model for you?</b>

11:14.750 --> 11:19.710
<b>Kurumi, you're... really 
starting to sound like Renge.</b>

11:19.710 --> 11:22.250
<b>Wha-?! Th-that's...</b>

11:22.710 --> 11:26.420
<b>B-but you two, you know...</b>

11:27.920 --> 11:32.210
<b>The two of you both were backup dancers
in the last Fortissimo concert, right?</b>

11:33.130 --> 11:35.580
<b>When I saw you two up there, I just knew!</b>

11:36.670 --> 11:41.420
<b>I could tell you two would go on
to become amazing stars!</b>

11:41.880 --> 11:46.920
<b>I just want to leave that image burned into my eyes!
My heart! And onto my hard drive!</b>

11:47.580 --> 11:50.710
<b>So please! Just let me snap some pictures!</b>

11:54.170 --> 11:56.080
<b>Well! In that case, then!</b>

11:56.080 --> 11:57.080
<b>What?!</b>

12:00.250 --> 12:02.080
<b>That's it! Like that!</b>

12:03.750 --> 12:07.000
<b>I can sense a new popstar 
legend being born right here!</b>

12:14.290 --> 12:17.290
<b>Now then! Let's try some new poses shall we?</b>

12:17.420 --> 12:18.580
<b>Okay!</b>

12:21.210 --> 12:25.750
<b>But why exactly are we in our bathing suits?</b>

12:25.750 --> 12:27.380
<b>What do you mean why?</b>

12:27.380 --> 12:31.040
<b>Popstars like us always have swimsuit shots!</b>

12:31.040 --> 12:32.460
<b>But still...</b>

12:32.790 --> 12:36.500
<b>Don't worry! You two look adorable!</b>

12:36.960 --> 12:39.040
<b>Now then, let's get back to shooting!</b>

12:39.040 --> 12:40.380
<b>Pose for me, pose!</b>

12:40.380 --> 12:43.460
<b>My, what an interesting little 
thing you're doing there.</b>

12:44.500 --> 12:46.250
<b>Urara. Kokomi.</b>

12:46.250 --> 12:49.790
<b>You two definitely are cut out to be stars.</b>

12:50.330 --> 12:54.380
<b>HS 2nd Year
Kanon Kougami</b>

12:50.330 --> 12:54.380
<b>However! Compared to us you're still just like
a couple of unpolished gems!</b>

12:54.380 --> 12:58.330
<b>HS 2nd Year
Shiho Kunieda</b>

12:54.880 --> 12:59.330
<b>We should show them what real stars are like,
shouldn't we, Kanon?</b>

13:02.210 --> 13:04.250
<b>Kano-Kano?</b>

13:04.250 --> 13:06.130
<b>And Shiho, too?</b>

13:06.420 --> 13:07.790
<b>Let's do this, Shiho!</b>

13:08.170 --> 13:09.250
<b>Got it!</b>

13:17.210 --> 13:19.500
<b>Why are you in your bathing suits?!</b>

13:19.500 --> 13:23.330
<b>Just in case they stumble upon a photo shoot?</b>

13:23.580 --> 13:26.080
<b>They make sure to always 
wear their suits is that it?</b>

13:26.290 --> 13:29.040
<b>So this is what real-deal stars are like...</b>

13:29.040 --> 13:30.330
<b>Wha-?!</b>

13:30.540 --> 13:32.790
<b>Oh my! That's perfect!</b>

13:32.790 --> 13:34.460
<b>Well? Come on then!</b>

13:34.460 --> 13:38.130
<b>Now then, how about this pose here?</b>

13:41.670 --> 13:44.420
<b>My, my, that was incredible.</b>

13:46.290 --> 13:50.130
<b>To think I'd get my hands on some
rare Fortissimo shots like these too!</b>

13:50.130 --> 13:52.330
<b>I need to make sure to save and lock these.</b>

13:56.250 --> 13:57.250
<b>Hmm?</b>

14:03.380 --> 14:06.000
<b>Out practicing your recorder 
in a place like this?</b>

14:08.420 --> 14:09.710
<b>Kurumi...</b>

14:12.670 --> 14:17.420
<b>Ah, so you're out here practicing
before your test tomorrow?</b>

14:17.830 --> 14:22.420
<b>Yeah, but, I just can't 
seem to get it right...</b>

14:23.080 --> 14:24.630
<b>Hey, Kurumi...</b>

14:25.000 --> 14:25.830
<b>Hmm?</b>

14:26.380 --> 14:29.750
<b>Kurumi, are you... any good at the recorder?</b>

14:29.750 --> 14:30.750
<b>Hmm?</b>

14:31.380 --> 14:33.130
<b>Well, maybe just average.</b>

14:33.130 --> 14:36.420
<b>Please then! Show me how it's done!</b>

14:36.420 --> 14:37.420
<b>Huh?!</b>

14:40.250 --> 14:43.920
<b>Sadone's recorder? In my...?</b>

14:47.000 --> 14:50.290
<b>Oh no! No, this is just too much!</b>

14:52.630 --> 14:54.250
<b>Please...!</b>

14:57.130 --> 15:00.250
<b>O-okay, sure. I've got you!</b>

15:19.880 --> 15:22.080
<b>Oh, I'm so sorry.</b>

15:23.670 --> 15:28.040
<b>I think I might have finally gone
beyond the point of no return!</b>

15:44.420 --> 15:46.710
<b>I am ha-ppy!</b>

15:46.710 --> 15:50.500
<b>Now then! Time to expand my collection!</b>

15:57.130 --> 15:59.130
<b>Can never be too careful...</b>

16:20.920 --> 16:22.420
<b>What was that?</b>

16:26.290 --> 16:27.380
<b>Oh, no!</b>

16:48.130 --> 16:49.130
<b>Alright!</b>

16:52.830 --> 16:54.880
<b>Come on and smile for me!</b>

17:03.170 --> 17:05.580
<b>What a wonderful day.</b>

17:05.960 --> 17:09.080
<b>I wouldn't mind getting 
to do this now and then!</b>

17:12.420 --> 17:17.540
<b>Now that I've made it this far,
I wish I could just figure out how to get Misaki...</b>

17:17.540 --> 17:20.080
<b>She's always got her guard up, though.</b>

17:25.880 --> 17:28.250
<b>Speak of the devil... Indeed.</b>

17:33.210 --> 17:35.210
<b>Are you feeling sick?</b>

17:35.210 --> 17:38.750
<b>What? No, not at all. Why?</b>

17:40.040 --> 17:43.210
<b>After class, you just sat 
there sighing at your desk.</b>

17:44.790 --> 17:46.880
<b>So you were worried about me!</b>

17:48.290 --> 17:50.170
<b>I'll wash your back for you.</b>

17:50.170 --> 17:51.670
<b>What? B-but...</b>

17:52.170 --> 17:54.790
<b>It's fine. It's to pay 
you back for last time.</b>

17:56.380 --> 18:00.750
<b>So she pulled a fast one and
got close to Misaki even before I did?</b>

18:01.290 --> 18:03.580
<b>Kurumi, you devil you.</b>

18:04.330 --> 18:07.710
<b>But! There are no second chances 
for this sort of stuff!</b>

18:07.710 --> 18:11.130
<b>Then after she's done, I'll 
wash her back for her, and...</b>

18:12.080 --> 18:15.960
<b>We'll do a bit of this and that,
and then maybe even some of that.</b>

18:16.540 --> 18:18.250
<b>Scrub, scrub, scrub!</b>

18:18.500 --> 18:21.420
<b>Oh! Sooo sorry! My hands just slipped!</b>

18:21.420 --> 18:22.670
<b>Oh my!</b>

18:27.500 --> 18:30.920
<b>I thought something was 
off ever since lunch...</b>

18:31.380 --> 18:34.580
<b>Oh? What now?</b>

18:34.880 --> 18:36.750
<b>You! You're not the real Kurumi!</b>

18:36.750 --> 18:37.790
<b>Huh?</b>

18:37.790 --> 18:40.580
<b>Wh-wh-what ever do you mean?</b>

18:40.580 --> 18:43.790
<b>I-If I'm not Kurumi then who am I?</b>

18:43.790 --> 18:46.540
<b>I've seen records of humanoid 
Irous in this region!</b>

18:46.540 --> 18:47.960
<b>Now then, you!</b>

18:49.920 --> 18:51.330
<b>It's time to die!</b>

18:51.330 --> 18:53.670
<b>Oh nooo!</b>

18:59.290 --> 19:03.120
<b>It would appear that Renge and Kurumi swapped bodies
</b>

19:03.890 --> 19:06.870
<b>as a result of their contact 
with the Irous yesterday.</b>

19:07.210 --> 19:09.210
<b>Reviewing the data it seems their minds</b>

19:09.210 --> 19:13.050
<b>were overwritten when their 
brains hit the same wavelength.</b>

19:13.050 --> 19:13.380
<b>No way!</b>

19:13.380 --> 19:14.210
<b>How awful! We need to bring Kurumi back!
No way!</b>

19:14.210 --> 19:15.420
<b>How awful! We need to bring Kurumi back!
Poor Kurumi!</b>

19:15.420 --> 19:16.580
<b>How awful! We need to bring Kurumi back!
Isn't there anything we can do?</b>

19:16.580 --> 19:17.250
<b>Isn't there anything we can do?</b>

19:17.250 --> 19:19.830
<b>Isn't anyone worried about me?</b>

19:21.460 --> 19:23.540
<b>And that's where our plan comes in.</b>

19:23.790 --> 19:27.960
<b>We've got reports of the same type of Irous
out in Section C.</b>

19:28.250 --> 19:33.080
<b>Renge and Kurumi are to head out immediately
and take down this Irous.</b>

19:33.750 --> 19:35.290
<b>Mrs. Yakumo...</b>

19:36.630 --> 19:38.130
<b>You don't mean to suggest...</b>

19:38.130 --> 19:39.580
<b>I do indeed.</b>

19:42.080 --> 19:45.620
<b>A-are you trying to say 
that you want me and Kurumi</b>

19:45.620 --> 19:49.080
<b>to go out there and get hit 
with that attack again?</b>

19:49.420 --> 19:50.500
<b>Wha...?</b>

19:52.210 --> 19:54.580
<b>No way!</b>

19:58.130 --> 20:00.290
<b>So, uhm...</b>

20:01.420 --> 20:05.830
<b>Everyone, I'm so sorry 
about everything yesterday.</b>

20:09.670 --> 20:11.500
<b>No need to apologize.</b>

20:11.670 --> 20:15.000
<b>At least you're back to normal now.</b>

20:15.290 --> 20:17.040
<b>I'm really sorry...</b>

20:17.040 --> 20:19.670
<b>I'm sorry for all the trouble.</b>

20:20.380 --> 20:23.080
<b>It was pretty easy switching them back, huh.</b>

20:23.080 --> 20:25.790
<b>We should just be happy 
things worked out, Subaru!</b>

20:28.000 --> 20:30.920
<b>Kurumi, I need to apologize to you, too.</b>

20:30.920 --> 20:32.710
<b>Wh-what? No.</b>

20:32.710 --> 20:35.880
<b>I used you as a disguise 
to do whatever I pleased...</b>

20:36.130 --> 20:38.630
<b>I'm embarrassed even thinking about it now...</b>

20:39.130 --> 20:40.830
<b>Renge...</b>

20:41.460 --> 20:43.500
<b>I think I just...</b>

20:43.500 --> 20:44.170
<b>Hmm?</b>

20:44.170 --> 20:48.130
<b>I want to do all that as my normal self!</b>

20:48.130 --> 20:48.710
<b>What?!</b>

20:48.710 --> 20:49.540
<b>Let's start with Mimi!
What?!</b>

20:49.540 --> 20:50.710
<b>Let's start with Mimi!</b>

20:50.710 --> 20:52.330
<b>Nooooo!</b>

20:52.330 --> 20:54.830
<b>She hasn't changed a bit!</b>

21:12.500 --> 21:18.960
<b>Mawatteru hazu demo tomatteru ki ga shite</b>

21:18.960 --> 21:25.290
<b>Hitori de nayande wakatteru furi</b>

21:25.290 --> 21:31.710
<b>Meimetsu no hate ni tozakaru risou o</b>

21:31.710 --> 21:37.460
<b>Hitomi ni utsushite hashiraseta noise</b>

21:37.460 --> 21:44.000
<b>Kodoku na rondeau ni torawareru ishi</b>

21:44.250 --> 21:47.670
<b>Kazashitara nukedashite</b>

21:47.670 --> 21:53.080
<b>Tomoni kanademashou saa</b>

21:53.210 --> 22:00.040
<b>Dare demo nai kimeru no 
wa jibun jishin dakara</b>

22:00.040 --> 22:06.210
<b>Seikai mo machigai mo "rashisa" ni kawatteku</b>

22:06.210 --> 22:13.000
<b>Kasanariai itsu no hi ka kanau to shinjitara</b>

22:13.000 --> 22:21.790
<b>Shiroi fumen kakidasu kono 
yo ni hitotsu dake no</b>

22:22.040 --> 22:25.040
<b>Ring out melody</b>

22:31.960 --> 22:36.500
<b>They sure are full of surprises, those girls.</b>

22:42.250 --> 22:45.880
<b>It looks like our next stage is all but set.</b>

22:54.500 --> 22:56.500
<b>I think it's about time.</b>

22:57.960 --> 23:00.880
<b>Oh, you little 19 Hoshimori girls...</b>

23:00.880 --> 23:04.830
<b>I do hope you'll let me have some fun...</b>

23:11.790 --> 23:14.290
<b>The sacred tree is unusually restless...</b>

23:18.540 --> 23:20.540
<b>Something is drawing in close...</b>

23:26.710 --> 23:29.290
<b>How can our attacks do nothing to it?</b>

23:29.290 --> 23:31.420
<b>This new Irous is way too strong!</b>

23:31.420 --> 23:32.460
<b>We've got this!</b>

23:32.460 --> 23:35.040
<b>As long as we all work 
together we can pull through!</b>

23:35.040 --> 23:36.920
<b>Next time: "Protective Power"!</b>

23:36.060 --> 23:41.060
<b>Next Episode
Protective Power
Leave it to me! Woof!</b>

23:36.920 --> 23:38.210
<b>Let's go, Haruka!</b>

23:38.210 --> 23:40.330
<b>Subaru, don't get yourself hurt!</b>
